flowchart LR
    Client[MAUI app or Postman]
    Auth[Auth API\nport 8081]
    Members[Members API\nport 8084]
    Events[Events API\nport 8082]
    Inventory[Inventory API\nport 8083]
    IPMA[IPMA Open Data\nweather forecast]
    AuthDB[(MongoDB\ntuna_auth)]
    MembersDB[(MongoDB\ntuna_members)]
    EventsDB[(MongoDB\ntuna_events)]
    InventoryDB[(MongoDB\ntuna_inventory)]

    Client -->|register and login| Auth
    Auth -->|signed JWT| Client
    Client -->|Bearer JWT and profile requests| Members
    Client -->|Bearer JWT and inventory requests| Inventory
    Client -->|Bearer JWT and event requests| Events
    Auth --> AuthDB
    Members --> MembersDB
    Events --> EventsDB
    Inventory --> InventoryDB
    Events -->|validate referenced items over REST| Inventory
    Events -->|daily forecast by GlobalIdLocal| IPMA
